@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - Physical Room State Machine

hide empty description

[*] --> AVAILABLE : room activated

state AVAILABLE
state OCCUPIED
state DIRTY
state MAINTENANCE

AVAILABLE --> OCCUPIED : guest checks in\n[valid assignment]
OCCUPIED --> DIRTY : guest checks out
DIRTY --> AVAILABLE : cleaning completed\n[inspection passed]

AVAILABLE --> MAINTENANCE : manager blocks room
DIRTY --> MAINTENANCE : issue found during cleaning
OCCUPIED --> MAINTENANCE : emergency incident\n[guest relocated]

MAINTENANCE --> DIRTY : repair completed\n[cleaning required]
MAINTENANCE --> AVAILABLE : repair and inspection completed\n[room already clean]

AVAILABLE --> [*] : room deactivated
MAINTENANCE --> [*] : room permanently retired

note right of AVAILABLE
  The room can be assigned at check-in.

  This status alone does not determine
  date-range availability for booking.
end note

note right of OCCUPIED
  A checked-in booking currently uses
  this physical room.
end note

note right of DIRTY
  The room cannot be assigned until
  housekeeping completes cleaning.
end note

note right of MAINTENANCE
  The room is blocked from assignment
  and excluded from operational inventory.
end note

legend bottom
  == Important distinction ==
  Room.status models the current operational condition of a physical room.
  Booking availability is calculated from room inventory minus overlapping
  PENDING, CONFIRMED and CHECKED_IN bookings for the requested date range.
endlegend

@enduml
